<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Professional Moving Script - Clear & Direct</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #2c3e50;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f5f7fa;
        }
        .script-container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #dcdde1;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #1e272e;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2f3542;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.5em;
        }
        .role {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .prospect { color: #d63031; }
        .you { color: #2f3542; }
        .line {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .action {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #57606f;
            background-color: #f1f2f6;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #f1f2f6;
            padding: 2px 4px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        hr {
            border: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: #ced6e0;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="script-container">
    <h1>B2B Moving Industry Script (Clear Delivery)</h1>
    
    <!-- Step 1: Introduction -->
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role prospect">Prospect:</span> Hello?
    </div>
    
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> Hello, am I speaking with the owner of <span class="highlight">{Business Name}</span>?
    </div>
    
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role prospect">Owner:</span> Yes, this is the owner.
    </div>
    
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> My name is <strong>[Your Name]</strong> with P&R Acquisition Group. How are you today? <br>
        <span class="action"> Pause for response </span>
    </div>

    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> I am calling because we help local moving companies get more jobs without using Google Ads or relying only on word-of-mouth. <br><br>
        Are you available to take on more jobs right now, or is your schedule completely full? <br>
        <span class="action"> Pause for response </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: Qualification -->
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> I understand. We currently work with four moving companies in <span class="highlight">{Their State}</span>. Our only focus is helping moving businesses get more booked jobs. <br><br>
        How do you currently get most of your moving jobs? <br>
        <span class="action"> Pause for response </span>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <!-- Step 3: The Value Proposition -->
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> Thank you for sharing that. The first step we take to increase your jobs is listing your business on our affiliate platforms. We send you job requests, and you can accept, decline, or reschedule them based on your availability. <br><br>
        Are you currently active on your Google Business Profile? <br>
        <span class="action"> Pause for response </span>
    </div>

    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> We manage that profile for you. We post updates four times per week and automate your customer reviews. <br><br>
        How do you collect reviews from your clients right now? <br>
        <span class="action"> Pause for response </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4: The Core Benefit -->
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> Our system makes review collection fully automatic. Typically, ninety-five percent of clients leave a review on your Google profile. <br><br>
        When we combine regular posts with consistent reviews, your business ranks higher on Google. This naturally brings more direct jobs to your business. <br><br>
        Do you have any questions about how this works? <br>
        <span class="action"> Answer any quick question, then move immediately to the close </span>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <!-- Step 5: The Close -->
    <div class="line">
        <span class="role you">You:</span> I would like to show you how our Local Starter Plan works and what job volume you can expect in your area. It takes about fifteen minutes. <br><br>
        Would tomorrow or Thursday work better for a short call?
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
